References: <CCDBD09A.14FC%tdcasasent@mdanderson.org> <C285CB34-7094-401C-B23B-9C19DD48FC0E@r-project.org> <0EE81863-01CE-4C65-8E0D-F7AF14D6CF14@stat.ucla.edu>
